@startuml
actor Client
participant TransactionService
participant LoginService
participant SQS
participant GameService

Client -> TransactionService: POST /transactions (TransactionRequest)
activate TransactionService
TransactionService -> LoginService: GET /me (Authorization: Bearer <token>)
activate LoginService
LoginService --> TransactionService: SessionDTO (username, sessionId, contractService...)
deactivate LoginService

TransactionService -> SQS: publish(TransactionEvent)
activate SQS
SQS --> TransactionService: 200 OK (async)
deactivate SQS

note over GameService,SQS: GameService will consume TransactionEvent from SQS
GameService -> SQS: poll/consume TransactionEvent
activate GameService
SQS --> GameService: TransactionEvent
GameService --> GameService: apply business rules (missions, levels, deduplication)
deactivate GameService

TransactionService --> Client: 202 ACCEPTED (TransactionResponse)
deactivate TransactionService
@enduml
